# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 4 and 8: the argument chooses the clause, whose places take the page's first positions (two wide, pick CS, so the page's own places are 2 to 4 either way), and its plain result is bound at the build.
test some_clause

tick 0
  added:
    0: Ui.Label(text="some 3")
    1: Ui.Label(text="second")
    2: Ui.Label(text="n3")
    3: Ui.Button(label="go")
    4: Ui.Label(text="n3 0")
  result: "n3"

tick 1
  in:
    3: click
  changed:
    4: Ui.Label(text="n3 1")

